@YpsAdmin.Api_HostAddress = http://localhost:5214

### Get Dashboard Summary Metrics
GET {{YpsAdmin.Api_HostAddress}}/api/dashboard/summary
Accept: application/json

### Get All Bus Lines
GET {{YpsAdmin.Api_HostAddress}}/api/buses?pageNumber=1&pageSize=10
Accept: application/json

### Get All Bus Stops
GET {{YpsAdmin.Api_HostAddress}}/api/bus-stops?pageNumber=1&pageSize=10
Accept: application/json

### Get All YPS Stores
GET {{YpsAdmin.Api_HostAddress}}/api/stores?pageNumber=1&pageSize=10
Accept: application/json

###
